  "title": "Keto Russian Myeolchi Anchovies Skewers",
  "description": "A post-workout Russian dish featuring myeolchi anchovies, cooked to a jammy and glassy-jelly texture using sous-vide and served on a salt block, perfect for a keto-friendly snack.",
