  "instructions": [
    "Sous-vide the myeolchi anchovies in a water bath at 130 degrees Fahrenheit for 30 minutes.",
    "Preheat the salt block in the oven at 400 degrees Fahrenheit for 10 minutes.",
    "Mix the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, dill, salt, black pepper, and paprika in a bowl.",
    "Thread the sous-vide myeolchi anchovies onto skewers.",
    "Brush the skewers with the olive oil mixture.",
    "Place the skewers on the preheated salt block and sear for 2 minutes per side.",
    "Serve the keto Russian myeolchi anchovies skewers immediately."
